         - API Endpoint: The primary API endpoint is \`https://api.example.com/v2\`.

        -->
    </key_knowledge>

    <file_system_state>
        <!-- List files that have been created, read, modified, or deleted. Note their status and critical learnings. -->
        <!-- Example:
